title: Taxes
subtitle: Treasury: a progressive or wealth tax, indirect taxes, a broader tax base or customs duties.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_finance.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'finance_package') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.finance_package (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.3). Z — 0.66 (decision 1A of 7 X 2026):
// the Treasury family has two cards, the taxes (polish_gov_finance) and the loan, savings and emission
// (polish_gov_finance_funding); both use the same rules of 11.9. Opening and closing the card are free; a confirmed option
// costs this month's action, or the one free step of an adviser who opened the card.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'finance_package');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_finance');
!}

= Taxes

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

One instrument per decision, voted by the Sejm at once; one instrument of each kind can be in force, and a temporary revenue ends when it expires.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

- @progressive
- @wealth_tax
- @indirect
- @broad
- @customs
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@progressive
title: Tax high incomes and wealth: a progressive tax
subtitle: Taxes rise one level, which brings the budget 1 unit a month; business pressure grows (+4); Lewica dissent falls (−3).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'finance_package', 'progressive').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_finance_package_progressive_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'finance_package', 'progressive');
!}
go-to: result

@wealth_tax
title: Tax high incomes and wealth: an extraordinary wealth tax
subtitle: Brings the budget 2 units a month for six months; business pressure grows (+8).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'finance_package', 'wealth_tax').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_finance_package_wealth_tax_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'finance_package', 'wealth_tax');
!}
go-to: result

@indirect
title: Tax broad groups: indirect taxes
subtitle: Taxes rise one level, which brings the budget 1 unit a month; the discontent of poor recipients grows (+3); Lewica dissent rises (+3).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'finance_package', 'indirect').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_finance_package_indirect_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'finance_package', 'indirect');
!}
go-to: result

@broad
title: Tax broad groups: a broader tax base
subtitle: Taxes rise one level, which brings the budget 1 unit a month; business pressure grows (+4); the discontent of the middle class covered grows (+3).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'finance_package', 'broad').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_finance_package_broad_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'finance_package', 'broad');
!}
go-to: result

@customs
title: Tax broad groups: fiscal customs duties
subtitle: Brings the budget 1 unit a month for six months; prices rise for two months (+1 percentage point) and the credit shock grows for six months (+3).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'finance_package', 'customs').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_finance_package_customs_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'finance_package', 'customs');
!}
go-to: result

